rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_1 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the aanvrager is_jonger dan18 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value V
    and V < 18
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a fourth value
    and the aow datum partner is a fifth value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value N
    and N >= 18
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value M
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value K
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value P
    and P < 18
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value Q
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value R
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value S
    and S >= 18
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_2 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the aanvrager is181920 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value V
    and 18 <= V
    and V < 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a fourth value
    and the aow datum partner is a fifth value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value N
    and 18 > N
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a value M
    and the aow datum partner is a value K
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value P
    and P >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value Q
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value R
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value S
    and 18 <= S
    and S < 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value T
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value U
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value W
    and 18 > W
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value X
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value Y
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value Z
    and Z >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_3 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the aanvrager is_tenminste21 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value V
    and V >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a fourth value
    and the aow datum partner is a fifth value
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value N
    and N < 21
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value M
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value K
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value P
    and P >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value Q
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value R
    and the leeftijd aanvrager is a value S
    and S < 21
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_4 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the aanvrager heeft aow leeftijd of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and the dag van aanvraag is a third value
    and the date written as the third value is a date D
    and the aow datum aanvrager is a fourth value
    and the date written as the fourth value is a date N
    and D >= N
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a fifth value
    and the aow datum partner is a sixth value
    and the dag van aanvraag is a value V
    and the date written as V is a date M
    and the aow datum aanvrager is a value K
    and the date written as K is a date P
    and M < P
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value Q
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value R
    and the dag van aanvraag is a value S
    and the date written as S is a date T
    and the aow datum aanvrager is a value U
    and the date written as U is a date W
    and T >= W
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value X
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value Y
    and the dag van aanvraag is a value Z
    and the date written as Z is a date B
    and the aow datum aanvrager is a value C
    and the date written as C is a date E
    and B < E
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_5 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the partner is_jonger dan18 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value V
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and V < 18
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a value N
    and the aow datum partner is a fourth value
    and N >= 18
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a fifth value
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a sixth value
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_6 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the partner is181920 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
