    and V < 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a value N
    and the aow datum partner is a fourth value
    and 18 > N
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a value M
    and the aow datum partner is a sixth value
    and M >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value K
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value P
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_7 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the partner is_tenminste21 of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value V
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and V >= 21
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a value N
    and the aow datum partner is a fourth value
