rule svb_leeftijdsgrenzen_8 with provenance the model at decision SVB Leeftijdsgrenzen:
the partner heeft aow leeftijd of the svb leeftijdsgrenzen is a truth value if
    the leeftijd partner is a value
    and the aow datum partner is a second value
    and the dag van aanvraag is a third value
    and the date written as the third value is a date D
    and the date written as the second value is a date N
    and D >= N
    and the truth value is equal to true
    otherwise the leeftijd partner is a fourth value
    and the aow datum partner is a fifth value
    and the dag van aanvraag is a sixth value
    and the date written as the sixth value is a date M
    and the date written as the fifth value is a date K
    and M < K
    and the truth value is equal to false
    otherwise it is not the case that the leeftijd partner is a value V
    and it is not the case that the aow datum partner is a value P
    and the truth value is equal to false.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_1 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 1:
the leeftijd aanvrager of the svb bereken leeftijden is a number if
    the geboortedatum partner is a value
    and the date written as the geboortedatum aanvrager is a date
    and the date written as the dag van aanvraag is a second date
    and the number of whole years from the date to the second date is the number.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_2 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 1:
the aow datum aanvrager of the svb bereken leeftijden is a text if
    the geboortedatum partner is a value
    and the date written as the geboortedatum aanvrager is a date
    and the text is the svb aow leeftijd calendar months after the date.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_3 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 1:
the leeftijd partner of the svb bereken leeftijden is a number if
    the date written as the geboortedatum partner is a date
    and the date written as the dag van aanvraag is a second date
    and the number of whole years from the date to the second date is the number.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_4 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 1:
the aow datum partner of the svb bereken leeftijden is a text if
