    and the text is the svb aow leeftijd calendar months after the date.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_5 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 2:
the leeftijd aanvrager of the svb bereken leeftijden is a number if
    it is not the case that the geboortedatum partner is a value
    and the geboortedatum aanvrager is a second value
    and the date written as the second value is a date
    and the dag van aanvraag is a third value
    and the date written as the third value is a second date
    and the number of whole years from the date to the second date is the number.

rule svb_bereken_leeftijden_6 with provenance the model at decision SVB Bereken Leeftijden rule 2:
the aow datum aanvrager of the svb bereken leeftijden is a text if
    it is not the case that the geboortedatum partner is a value
    and the geboortedatum aanvrager is a second value
    and the date written as the second value is a date
    and the svb aow leeftijd is a number
    and the text is the number calendar months after the date.

